Subject: [PATCH] tinycast-space 0006: inline alias shortcut editing
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

⌘K on a launcher entry gains *Change Alias* and *Change Shortcut* rows that edit in place (extension commands included). Ported from [jhasubhash/tinycast](https://github.com/jhasubhash/tinycast/commit/f509d005) (AGPL-3.0); everything lives in the new `InlineEntryEditor.swift`, the rest is one-line hooks marked `tinycast-space`. `apply.sh` regenerates `project.pbxproj` with XcodeGen for the added file instead of patching it.

Origin: tinycast-space 0006-inline-alias-shortcut-editing.patch @ ffccfc3
